    "summary": "A pair of man&#039;s short leather trousers; summer wear.  Shaped into a point at middle back; chevron-shaped decoration below, using brown and tan pigment and blue woven cloth (latter much worn).  Fastened with leather drawstring.  Front panel has alternating bands of pigment (as before) and two strips of cloth: red tabby woollen cloth and beige/cream printed tabby cotton cloth, latter extending to waistline.  Embellished with (interrupted) lines of transparent, light brown and black glass beads.  Four identical human figures, in black pigment, painted at top sides (back panel) and lower sides (triangular-shaped panel).",
